Feyrock is a green stone that is not native to [[Færrin]] or to Færrin Prime. It comes from somewhere starward, toward the [[Godhome]] and the angelic, though nobody has ever located the source. Pieces turn up now and then and sell for large sums at auction, valued because they are rare and pretty. The street name comes from the belief that it is Fey in origin.

No magic anyone has been able to find lives in the stone, but a Feyrock carved as a leaf, found under [[Lyric Burke]]'s pillow, pulled toward the [[Verdant Expanse]]. In hand it vibrated as the forest neared; worn on its cord it lifted an inch above the wearer's chest and pointed the way deeper in.
